<title>USA: Medaphis says it is named in lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Medaphis says it is named in lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medaphis Corp said on Tuesday that Medical Management Sciences Inc, which Medaphis acquired in December 1995 in a stock transaction, had filed a lawsuit against the company.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate on the charges, but said it intended to defend itself vigorously.</p>
<p>&quot;Medaphis believes it has meritorious defenses to the claims,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Medaphis provides business management services to healthcare providers.</p>
</text>
